{"name": "PhaigeX: Confiners", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/bfc654deb69874528bb2a01c05f8ec97.poster.avif?t=1792684846\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/bfc654deb69874528bb2a01c05f8ec97.webm?t=1792684846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/bfc654deb69874528bb2a01c05f8ec97.mp4?t=1792684846\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As a Confiner of PhaigeX Corp, you'll be deployed to hyperspace frontiers tasked to contain the rising rogue A.I. threat. Pilot advanced Phaige units, execute high-risk commissions, and secure the future through tech, territory, and triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/6c773621d05e8d6ea259c76afd3c7407.poster.avif?t=1792684846\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/6c773621d05e8d6ea259c76afd3c7407.webm?t=1792684846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/6c773621d05e8d6ea259c76afd3c7407.mp4?t=1792684846\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Race through hostile sectors packed with enemy ships, dodging missile fire and striking back with precision. Designed for intense chases and split-second turns, your mastery of speed and weaponry will decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/ca0b6d91ffe221c705434f0623a93318.poster.avif?t=1792684846\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/ca0b6d91ffe221c705434f0623a93318.webm?t=1792684846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/ca0b6d91ffe221c705434f0623a93318.mp4?t=1792684846\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every mission drops you into a new battlefield shaped by shifting threats and high-risk conditions. Whether it\u2019s enemy offensives, environmental surges, or unpredictable skirmishes, your PHGX unit must rise to every challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/8f97843b6e6682322b68b622cec02f9f.poster.avif?t=1792684846\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/8f97843b6e6682322b68b622cec02f9f.webm?t=1792684846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/8f97843b6e6682322b68b622cec02f9f.mp4?t=1792684846\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Outfit your Phaige unit with modular weapons and ship upgrades that suit your tactics. From precision long-range barrages to missile spams, your loadout and ship systems will define how you fight \u2014 and how you win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURE LIST:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the role of a Confiner and take on daring, high-risk commissions under PhaigeX command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a wide array of modules to fine-tune and transform your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your resources\u2014ammo and energy are limited, and every shot counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command multiple PhaigeX ships and pair them with specialized support crafts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge unique weapons by combining parts, creating new behaviors and effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Towards a brighter future,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"105\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/extras/f833047ff1bc0ac09e52ba212fc1a193.avif?t=1792684846\" width=\"400\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Welcome aboard, Confiner! As PhaigeX Megacorp\u2019s newest specialist, you\u2019re tasked with curbing the AI incursion into hyperspace sectors. Choose your ship, upgrade your modules, accept commissions, and deploy adaptive stratagems to fend off the relentless AI invasion.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909480/327cd2e64388d4aff3f1a399001face5da8ba35f/header.jpg?t=1792684846", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Action Roguelike", "Space", "Roguelite", "Space Sim", "Sci-fi"], "developers": "Traitorean Games", "publishers": "Traitorean Games", "release_date": "Oct 22, 2026", "price": "$8.49", "appid": "3909480", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "22 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/oSKxAlOeIfg", "first_seen": 1792620000.0, "review_rank": 7}